1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,407
Hi friends!

2
00:00:01,407 --> 00:00:03,304
Let's wash our hands!

3
00:00:03,854 --> 00:00:06,213
Clean hands keep us healthy!

4
00:00:07,563 --> 00:00:10,801
First, turn on the water and wet your hands.

5
00:00:11,201 --> 00:00:13,116
Splash, splash!

6
00:00:14,466 --> 00:00:16,466
Then add some soap.

7
00:00:16,866 --> 00:00:18,358
Bubbly soap!

8
00:00:19,708 --> 00:00:20,931
Wash, wash,

9
00:00:20,931 --> 00:00:22,591
wash your hands!

10
00:00:22,891 --> 00:00:25,230
Scrub away the germs!

11
00:00:26,330 --> 00:00:28,492
Rub your hands together.

12
00:00:28,492 --> 00:00:29,854
Rub, rub, rub!

13
00:00:30,254 --> 00:00:32,794
Rub the fronts and backs!

14
00:00:34,144 --> 00:00:36,094
Wash between your fingers,

15
00:00:36,094 --> 00:00:37,977
and make lots of bubbles.

16
00:00:38,377 --> 00:00:40,454
So many bubbles!

17
00:00:41,804 --> 00:00:43,027
Wash, wash,

18
00:00:43,027 --> 00:00:44,687
wash your hands!

19
00:00:44,987 --> 00:00:47,326
Scrub away the germs!

20
00:00:48,426 --> 00:00:50,688
Rinse the bubbles away.

21
00:00:51,088 --> 00:00:53,325
Bye bye, bubbles!

22
00:00:54,675 --> 00:00:57,080
Dry your hands with a towel.

23
00:00:57,480 --> 00:00:59,637
Pat, pat, all dry!

24
00:01:00,987 --> 00:01:03,154
When do we wash our hands?

25
00:01:03,554 --> 00:01:05,469
Before we eat!

26
00:01:06,819 --> 00:01:09,339
After we use the potty!

27
00:01:09,889 --> 00:01:12,168
And after we play outside!

28
00:01:13,518 --> 00:01:16,421
Look, my hands are squeaky clean!

29
00:01:16,971 --> 00:01:19,209
Great job, little learner!

30
00:01:19,759 --> 00:01:21,647
Share Mimzi with a friend,

31
00:01:21,647 --> 00:01:24,187
and subscribe for more learning fun!

32
00:01:24,737 --> 00:01:25,805
Next time,

33
00:01:25,805 --> 00:01:28,024
it's my bedtime routine.

34
00:01:28,274 --> 00:01:29,645
Bye bye!
